Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.88,0:11:55.68,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}手を銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.07,0:12:00.03,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}手を銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.03,0:12:04.16,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}手を銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.16,0:12:08.41,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}さあ　手と手繋いで
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.41,0:12:12.17,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}サガを世界へ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.89,0:12:15.42,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}Yes　サガ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.97,0:12:27.21,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}またたく宇宙に憧れて（焦がれ）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.21,0:12:31.38,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}前人未到の旅は続く（旅へ）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.38,0:12:35.44,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}妄想幻想じみた目標だって（絶対に）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.44,0:12:39.14,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}通過点になっていくんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.72,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}そう　ここはサガだ（ここにあるんだ）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.80,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}夢は何処だ（ここにあるんだ）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.80,0:12:47.63,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}誰だって皆突飛な惑星の中
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.93,0:12:50.20,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}愛はここだ（さがしながら）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.19,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}目指してるんだ（さがしながら）
Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.19,0:12:56.54,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}幾千銀河超えて輝く　サガ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.55,0:13:04.35,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}やがて地球を照らして
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.35,0:13:08.45,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}どんな不可能も
Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.69,0:13:13.84,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}可能だってしるしになる
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.23,0:13:20.84,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}小さな光繋いで
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.03,Insert 2 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}これからも　ずっと…
Dialogue: 6,0:11:39.30,0:11:43.01,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:43.66,0:11:47.77,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:47.77,0:11:51.48,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:51.88,0:11:55.68,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:56.07,0:12:00.03,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:12:00.03,0:12:04.16,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 6,0:12:04.16,0:12:08.41,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}来吧  让我们牵起手
Dialogue: 6,0:12:08.41,0:12:12.17,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将佐贺带往世界
Dialogue: 6,0:12:12.89,0:12:15.42,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}Yes  佐贺
Dialogue: 6,0:12:22.97,0:12:27.21,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}憧憬着闪耀的宇宙（向往着）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:27.21,0:12:31.38,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}前所未有的旅程仍在继续（在路上）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:31.38,0:12:35.44,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即便是妄想幻想一般的目标（绝对会）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:35.44,0:12:39.14,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}也逐渐成为中转站
Dialogue: 6,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.72,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}没错  这里正是佐贺（就在脚下）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.80,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}梦想处在何方（就在此处）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:43.80,0:12:47.63,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}在所有人都能异想天开的这个星球上
Dialogue: 6,0:12:47.93,0:12:50.20,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}爱就在这里（寻觅着）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.19,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}朝着目标前进（寻觅着）
Dialogue: 6,0:12:52.19,0:12:56.54,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}让数千银河黯然失色的光芒  佐贺
Dialogue: 6,0:12:57.55,0:13:04.35,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}终将照亮整个地球
Dialogue: 6,0:13:04.35,0:13:08.45,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}无论看似多么不可能
Dialogue: 6,0:13:08.69,0:13:13.84,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}都会成为一切皆可能的证据
Dialogue: 6,0:13:14.23,0:13:20.84,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}小小的光芒彼此相连
Dialogue: 6,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.03,Insert 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}从今往后也要一直…
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.12,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}みんなで　背負うから
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.12,0:14:23.23,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}あした　笑えるんだろう
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.23,0:14:26.93,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}道をあけろ　SAY WOW SAY WOW
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.93,0:14:30.82,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}待ち受ける嵐へと向かえ
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.82,0:14:35.40,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}束ねた　手のひらで　未来
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.40,0:14:39.49,Insert 3 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}掴むために
Dialogue: 6,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.12,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}正因众人共同担负
Dialogue: 6,0:14:19.12,0:14:23.23,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}明天也能展露笑颜
Dialogue: 6,0:14:23.23,0:14:26.93,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}闯出前路  高声呼喊
Dialogue: 6,0:14:26.93,0:14:30.82,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}直面即将来临的风暴
Dialogue: 6,0:14:30.82,0:14:35.40,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}手心相合  为了将未来
Dialogue: 6,0:14:35.40,0:14:39.49,Insert 3 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}牢牢把握
Dialogue: 5,1:05:58.36,1:06:05.36,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}瓦礫の底で　芽吹いた夢
Dialogue: 5,1:06:05.36,1:06:16.01,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}空よ　見えているか
Dialogue: 5,1:06:22.61,1:06:25.49,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}絶望　失望　問題無い
Dialogue: 5,1:06:25.49,1:06:28.96,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}蹴散らせ　訳有りの門前払い
Dialogue: 5,1:06:28.96,1:06:32.35,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}清濁　生没　正念場
Dialogue: 5,1:06:32.35,1:06:36.16,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}類いまれな命　駆け抜けろ
Dialogue: 5,1:06:36.16,1:06:42.83,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}食らいついた生に　溢れだす埋葬
Dialogue: 5,1:06:42.83,1:06:48.98,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}ぞんざいな玉砕は　数えきれない
Dialogue: 5,1:06:48.98,1:06:53.28,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}抉り出そう
Dialogue: 5,1:06:48.98,1:06:55.91,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}{\an9}上出来な成仏を　かなぐり捨てたら
Dialogue: 5,1:06:55.91,1:06:59.86,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}届くまで
Dialogue: 5,1:06:57.36,1:07:01.62,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}{\an9}歌声　空を突け
Dialogue: 5,1:07:02.37,1:07:07.88,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}なぜに咲いた　生き尽くすために咲いた
Dialogue: 5,1:07:07.88,1:07:15.70,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}遮るな　絶望じゃ花は腐らない
Dialogue: 5,1:07:15.70,1:07:23.09,Insert 4 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}一度散った　傷を抱く者は難攻不落　気高くあれ
Dialogue: 6,1:05:58.36,1:06:05.36,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}在瓦砾之下萌芽的梦想
Dialogue: 6,1:06:05.36,1:06:16.01,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}天空啊  你能否看见
Dialogue: 6,1:06:22.61,1:06:25.49,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}绝望  失望  不成问题
Dialogue: 6,1:06:25.49,1:06:28.96,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}一脚踹开  将心怀不轨者拒之门外
Dialogue: 6,1:06:28.96,1:06:32.35,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}善恶  生死  紧要关头
Dialogue: 6,1:06:32.35,1:06:36.16,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}绝无仅有的生命  必将全力以赴
Dialogue: 6,1:06:36.16,1:06:42.83,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}在拼死咬住的生机中  埋葬之物蜂拥而出
Dialogue: 6,1:06:42.83,1:06:48.98,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}荒唐的牺牲数不胜数
Dialogue: 6,1:06:48.98,1:06:53.28,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}挖掘出来吧
Dialogue: 6,1:06:48.98,1:06:55.91,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}{\an9}将圆满的成佛彻底割舍
Dialogue: 6,1:06:55.91,1:06:59.86,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}直到传达为止
Dialogue: 6,1:06:57.36,1:07:01.62,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}{\an9}让歌声响彻天际
Dialogue: 6,1:07:02.37,1:07:07.88,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}为何而绽放  为了燃尽生命
Dialogue: 6,1:07:07.88,1:07:15.70,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}别挡路  绝望无法使花枯萎
Dialogue: 6,1:07:15.70,1:07:23.09,Insert 4 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}曾一度凋零  身怀伤痕者坚不可摧  高不可攀
Dialogue: 5,1:17:49.64,1:17:54.02,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}誰が弔う　死地は彼方
Dialogue: 5,1:17:55.19,1:18:00.15,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}静寂を破り　芽吹いた夢を
Dialogue: 5,1:18:00.49,1:18:04.39,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}誓え　穿て
Dialogue: 5,1:18:05.54,1:18:11.08,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}重なる屍　高みへ
Dialogue: 5,1:18:11.08,1:18:15.28,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}届くまで
Dialogue: 5,1:18:16.80,1:18:20.44,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}唸れ　徒花
Dialogue: 5,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.21,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}朽ち果てても進め
Dialogue: 5,1:18:23.21,1:18:29.50,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}奪わせはしない尊厳の愚弄に　飢餓を解き放て
Dialogue: 5,1:18:29.50,1:18:34.48,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}枯れても走る　ことを命と呼べ
Dialogue: 5,1:18:34.48,1:18:37.61,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}空に叫ぶ　脱・生存の定義
Dialogue: 5,1:18:37.61,1:18:41.56,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}骨を斬らせて　闇を断て
Dialogue: 5,1:18:41.56,1:18:45.91,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}雲間に光る　{\alpha&HFF&}〇{\alpha&H00&}奪の勝機{\iclip(226.67,69.74,258.11,102.56)}
Dialogue: 4,1:18:41.56,1:18:45.91,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}{\alpha&HFF&}雲間に光る　{\alpha&H00&\fnVK10602B\fs33}篡{\alpha&HFF&\fs32}奪の勝機
Dialogue: 5,1:18:45.91,1:18:49.44,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}覚悟を　宿命に突きつけて
Dialogue: 5,1:18:49.44,1:18:52.34,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}天下に狂い咲く　サガ
Dialogue: 5,1:18:52.34,1:18:57.22,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}SAGA
Dialogue: 5,1:18:58.76,1:19:03.22,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}傷ひとつ無い　手など愚か
Dialogue: 5,1:19:04.34,1:19:09.72,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}意思も自由も　その身を投げて
Dialogue: 5,1:19:09.72,1:19:13.72,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}守れ　退くな
Dialogue: 5,1:19:14.73,1:19:20.00,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}涙も　血も無い　神話を
Dialogue: 5,1:19:20.00,1:19:24.35,Insert 5 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}築くまで
Dialogue: 6,1:17:49.64,1:17:54.02,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}葬身远方  问谁能悼念
Dialogue: 6,1:17:55.19,1:18:00.15,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}梦想萌芽  撕裂一片死寂
Dialogue: 6,1:18:00.49,1:18:04.39,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}起誓  破土而出
Dialogue: 6,1:18:05.54,1:18:11.08,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}群尸集结  向着高处
Dialogue: 6,1:18:11.08,1:18:15.28,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}不断前进
Dialogue: 6,1:18:16.80,1:18:20.44,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}咆哮吧  徒然零落之花
Dialogue: 6,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.21,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即便腐朽衰败也要向前
Dialogue: 6,1:18:23.21,1:18:29.50,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}尊严不可被夺走  对嘲笑者释放饥饿
Dialogue: 6,1:18:29.50,1:18:34.48,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}腐朽后仍要奔跑  这便是所谓生命
Dialogue: 6,1:18:34.48,1:18:37.61,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}对天嚎叫  超脱生存的定义
Dialogue: 6,1:18:37.61,1:18:41.56,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}割舍吾骨  断绝黑暗
Dialogue: 6,1:18:41.56,1:18:45.91,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}云缝透出光芒  窥见篡夺的胜机
Dialogue: 6,1:18:45.91,1:18:49.44,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}向宿命展现决心
Dialogue: 6,1:18:49.44,1:18:52.34,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}在天下怒放吧  佐贺
Dialogue: 6,1:18:52.34,1:18:57.22,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}传奇
Dialogue: 6,1:18:58.76,1:19:03.22,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}不想弄伤双手无异于痴人说梦
Dialogue: 6,1:19:04.34,1:19:09.72,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}舍弃意识与自由  将此身奉献
Dialogue: 6,1:19:09.72,1:19:13.72,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}坚守  别后退
Dialogue: 6,1:19:14.73,1:19:20.00,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}直至无泪无血的神话
Dialogue: 6,1:19:20.00,1:19:24.35,Insert 5 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}实现为止
Dialogue: 5,1:20:40.65,1:20:45.74,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}今日が歴史に残るなら
Dialogue: 5,1:20:48.13,1:20:53.79,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}燃える眩しさを刻もう
Dialogue: 5,1:20:55.16,1:21:00.21,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}同じ奇跡を夢みて
Dialogue: 5,1:21:02.67,1:21:07.36,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}誰も独りにしないと
Dialogue: 5,1:21:07.36,1:21:10.45,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}意地を貫け
Dialogue: 5,1:21:11.41,1:21:13.06,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}ひとつだけ
Dialogue: 5,1:21:15.98,1:21:18.64,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}永遠があると
Dialogue: 5,1:21:18.64,1:21:23.67,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}絆を見せつけろ
Dialogue: 5,1:21:24.93,1:21:28.44,Insert 6 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}歌い進め　SAY WOW SAY WOW
Dialogue: 6,1:20:40.65,1:20:45.74,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}若今日能留入历史
Dialogue: 6,1:20:48.13,1:20:53.79,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}便记下这燃烧的光华吧
Dialogue: 6,1:20:55.16,1:21:00.21,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}梦想着同一个奇迹
Dialogue: 6,1:21:02.67,1:21:07.36,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}不落下任何一人
Dialogue: 6,1:21:07.36,1:21:10.45,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将意志贯彻始终
Dialogue: 6,1:21:11.41,1:21:13.06,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}若问那唯一
Dialogue: 6,1:21:15.98,1:21:18.64,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}永恒不灭之物
Dialogue: 6,1:21:18.64,1:21:23.67,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}那便展现我们的纽带吧
Dialogue: 6,1:21:24.93,1:21:28.44,Insert 6 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}高歌向前  高声呼喊
Dialogue: 5,1:30:46.34,1:30:49.47,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}時は戻らない　向き合うだけ
Dialogue: 5,1:30:49.47,1:30:52.72,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}過去の栄光は　遠ざかるもの
Dialogue: 5,1:30:52.72,1:30:56.47,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}粘って行こう　Never give up again
Dialogue: 5,1:30:56.47,1:30:59.47,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}敗北に価値を与えるため
Dialogue: 5,1:30:59.47,1:31:03.10,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}立ち上がって　振りかざせ　傷ついた腕を
Dialogue: 5,1:31:03.10,1:31:07.24,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}苦汁飲んで　Could you stand up again
Dialogue: 5,1:31:07.24,1:31:10.68,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}引き際とか　弁えなんて
Dialogue: 5,1:31:10.68,1:31:14.44,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}弱音が　遺言じゃ終われない
Dialogue: 5,1:31:14.44,1:31:17.80,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}再起に賭けろ　七転びしても
Dialogue: 5,1:31:17.80,1:31:23.43,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}途切れた　溜め込んだ　願いを吐き出せ
Dialogue: 5,1:31:28.15,1:31:31.80,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}例え勝ち目のない戦いでも
Dialogue: 5,1:31:31.80,1:31:35.64,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}夢も覚悟も変わらない
Dialogue: 5,1:31:35.64,1:31:39.14,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}失望を　屈辱を　失敗を　後悔を
Dialogue: 5,1:31:39.14,1:31:42.20,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}炎にくべて高く狼煙を
Dialogue: 5,1:31:42.20,1:31:49.77,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}いつか世界中が見放しても　命の限り挑もう
Dialogue: 5,1:31:49.77,1:31:55.56,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}決断を　執念を　挽回を　復活を遂げて　眩しい魂
Dialogue: 5,1:31:55.56,1:32:00.29,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}突きつけろ
Dialogue: 5,1:32:11.09,1:32:17.68,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}走り倒れた最後を　空が許したとしても
Dialogue: 5,1:32:18.26,1:32:21.70,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}爪痕は　残せてない　
Dialogue: 5,1:32:21.70,1:32:27.26,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}犬死なんて許せない
Dialogue: 5,1:32:28.44,1:32:35.96,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}いつか世界中が見放しても　命の限り挑もう
Dialogue: 5,1:32:35.96,1:32:41.70,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}決断を　執念を　挽回を　復活を遂げて　眩しい魂
Dialogue: 5,1:32:41.87,1:32:46.67,Insert 7 - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}突きつけろ
Dialogue: 6,1:30:46.34,1:30:49.47,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}时光无法倒流  唯有直面当下
Dialogue: 6,1:30:49.47,1:30:52.72,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}曾经的荣光  已留在遥远的过去
Dialogue: 6,1:30:52.72,1:30:56.47,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}坚持到底  此生仍不言弃
Dialogue: 6,1:30:56.47,1:30:59.47,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}为了从失败中找到价值
Dialogue: 6,1:30:59.47,1:31:03.10,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}重新站起来  高举伤痕累累的手
Dialogue: 6,1:31:03.10,1:31:07.24,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}卧薪尝胆  你能否再次忍耐
Dialogue: 6,1:31:07.24,1:31:10.68,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}何谓知难而退  不懂适可而止
Dialogue: 6,1:31:10.68,1:31:14.44,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}遗书里可写不下泄气话
Dialogue: 6,1:31:14.44,1:31:17.80,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即使反复摔倒  仍相信重新振作的希望
Dialogue: 6,1:31:17.80,1:31:23.43,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}将那一度中断  积郁已久的愿望宣泄出来
Dialogue: 6,1:31:28.15,1:31:31.80,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即使身处没有胜算的战斗
Dialogue: 6,1:31:31.80,1:31:35.64,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}梦想和决心都不会动摇
Dialogue: 6,1:31:35.64,1:31:39.14,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}失望  屈辱  失败  后悔
Dialogue: 6,1:31:39.14,1:31:42.20,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}统统丢进火中烧作冲天狼烟
Dialogue: 6,1:31:42.20,1:31:49.77,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即使终会被世界抛弃  也要用尽生命挑战
Dialogue: 6,1:31:49.77,1:31:55.56,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}决断  执念  挽回  复活  终将实现  让灵魂升华
Dialogue: 6,1:31:55.56,1:32:00.29,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}证明这一切吧
Dialogue: 6,1:32:11.09,1:32:17.68,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即使上天见证了倒下前奋力奔跑的姿态
Dialogue: 6,1:32:18.26,1:32:21.70,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}仍未留下爪痕
Dialogue: 6,1:32:21.70,1:32:27.26,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}岂能白白死去
Dialogue: 6,1:32:28.44,1:32:35.96,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}即使终会被世界抛弃  也要用尽生命挑战
Dialogue: 6,1:32:35.96,1:32:41.70,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}决断  执念  挽回  复活  终将实现  让灵魂升华
Dialogue: 6,1:32:41.87,1:32:46.67,Insert 7 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur8}证明这一切吧
